  "brief": {
    "en": "A short nap at the SA/PA has done its job: drowsiness collapsed from 100 to 37 and fatigue from 56 to just 4. Stopped in the parking area, AICA no longer needs to fight sleepiness with music -- the top-ranked service switches entirely to stretch_video, a physical-recovery activity. Content (offered through the fallback music service since no karaoke service reaches the top-3) now scores low: the story has moved from 'push a driving song' to 'help the body recover'.",
    "ja": "SA/PAでの短い仮眠が効いた：眠気は100から37へ、疲労は56からわずか4へ低下。駐車エリアで停車中のAICAはもう音楽で眠気と戦う必要がなく、最上位サービスはstretch_video（体を動かす回復系アクティビティ）へ完全に切り替わる。コンテンツ（カラオケ系サービスが上位3に入らないためフォールバックのmusic_playlistで評価）のスコアは低い — 物語は「運転用の曲を推す」から「体の回復を助ける」へと移った。"
